<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n13344" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποξύνω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>bring to a point, make taper,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποξύνουσιν ἐρετμά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					6.269
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				9.326
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMar.</u>
				2.2
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>Ign.</u>
				52
			</span></i>: pf.
			part.<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀπωξυμμένος</span> or
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-υσμένος,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				18.18.13
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1.22.7
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὦτα -ξυσμένα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Gal.
					7.30
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>make sharp and piercing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν φωνήν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					<u>TG</u>
					2
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense4"><b>b.</b>
			<i>intensify,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θερμότητα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					2.695d
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>make sour,</i> [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὴν τροφήν</span>]
				<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Vict.</u>
				3.76
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Asclep.Jun.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				13.164
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Sor.
				1.107
			</span></i>.</div>
